RESEARCH / EDUCATIONAL SOFTWARE — kernel-mode.
This project is a research experiment. It is kernel-mode code that, to load,
requires weakening Windows security (test-signing; disabling Smart App Control /
Memory Integrity) and may cause system instability (bug checks / "BSOD"). Build
and run it only on hardware you own, on a non-production or virtual machine.
Use only against networks and devices you own or are explicitly authorized to
test. Provided "AS IS", without warranty; the authors accept no liability.
